[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 1562.39, "timestamp": "00:26:02", "text": "用戶的聊天記錄都在這裡。就像我這樣設定我的 YouTube 和 Twitch 聊天室一樣。  我也有你的聊天記錄。  你也有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1572.07, "timestamp": "00:26:12", "text": "自己的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1585.43, "timestamp": "00:26:25", "text": "線程系統。  你的所有聊天記錄都已記錄在這裡。我是經由 Sammy 完成的。是的，因為我比較喜歡那樣。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1591.269, "timestamp": "00:26:31", "text": "所以這也有助於控制局面等等。  適度之類的，比如說，你忘了做某件事。我還有一個提醒功能，就像我們從《"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1593.909, "timestamp": "00:26:33", "text": "冰雪奇緣》學到的，然後YouTube上說要喝溫水，還有，呃，Satakan，記得喝水，這很重要。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1611.75, "timestamp": "00:26:51", "text": "現在"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 1613.547, "timestamp": "00:26:53", "author": "@adthirnegii555", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/2Cc1YwU-uCrqW2z5qvi5AkqQE1B24SRxdmfPyDze9eyV1Sux1rRBrAOLxTFmE3GC3YMqYbZsL6k=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "hello"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1618.23, "timestamp": "00:26:58", "text": "聊天室裡的人可以用這個感嘆號提醒 Jock，還可以發訊息提醒他，比如“我應該玩某個遊戲了”或者“我忘了”，聊天"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 1619.085, "timestamp": "00:26:59", "author": "@adthirnegii555", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/2Cc1YwU-uCrqW2z5qvi5AkqQE1B24SRxdmfPyDze9eyV1Sux1rRBrAOLxTFmE3GC3YMqYbZsL6k=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "joqqqqqqyyyyyy"}]